{"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/registerwhatsappnumber:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Registers a WhatsApp number for WhatsApp Business messaging.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"registerWhatsappNumber:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"number"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The phone number in E.164 international format.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"number"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Associates a WhatsApp number with the current device for WhatsApp Business API","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"messaging campaigns. This enables rich messaging with images, documents, and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"interactive buttons through WhatsApp.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The phone number must be in E.164 international format:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Start with ‘+’ followed by country code","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No spaces, dashes, or parentheses"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Must be a valid WhatsApp-enabled number"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Register WhatsApp during communication preferences setup:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["class CommunicationPreferencesManager {","","    struct Preferences {","        var pushEnabled: Bool","        var smsEnabled: Bool","        var whatsappEnabled: Bool","        var whatsappNumber: String?","    }","","    func savePreferences(_ preferences: Preferences) {","        \/\/ Register WhatsApp if user opted in and provided number","        if preferences.whatsappEnabled, let number = preferences.whatsappNumber {","            let normalizedNumber = normalizePhoneNumber(number)","            Pushwoosh.configure.registerWhatsappNumber(normalizedNumber)","        }","","        \/\/ Update channel preferences tags","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"channel_push\": preferences.pushEnabled,","            \"channel_sms\": preferences.smsEnabled,","            \"channel_whatsapp\": preferences.whatsappEnabled","        ])","    }","","    private func normalizePhoneNumber(_ phone: String) -> String {","        let digits = phone.filter { $0.isNumber }","        return phone.hasPrefix(\"+\") ? \"+\\(digits)\" : \"+\\(digits)\"","    }","}"]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/registerWhatsappNumber:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)registerWhatsappNumber:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"registerWhatsappNumber:"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"registerWhatsappNumber:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"registerWhatsappNumber:","roleHeading":"Type Method","symbol